- For domestic goods requiring installation and commissioning with FOR dispatching station delivery, payment is structured as:  
  • 60 % upon proof of dispatch and supporting documents;  
  • 30 % upon receipt and acceptance of goods at the site;  
  • 10 % upon successful installation, commissioning and final acceptance.  

This milestone‑based split ties payment to performance, mitigates financial risk, ensures value for money and promotes transparent procurement that aligns with strategic corporate objectives. (Procurement of Goods Manual, p. 108)

